<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Semi Automatic Rifle FOV 90 - Sensetivity 0.82</Major>
    <Description>Semi Automatic Rifle FOV 90 - Sensetivity 0.82
Best with 800 dpi, sens normaly 0.82 ~ FOV  90
You can adjust it to your FOV
FOV 75 - Sensetivity 1.0
FOV 80 - Sensetivity 0.94
FOV 85 - Sensetivity 0.88
FOV 90 - Sensetivity 0.82

What to do:

________EU____________
1. Don't use snap to window, tick it off if its ticked on.
2. You can use the driver option if you preffer to.
3. Always use inkognito mode.
4. Use minimum delay to the minimum (for better performance.)
5. If you don't have in setttings the option hold to use, then tick that.
6. Add it to your prefered key and start the macro.
Good to go :)

________RU____________

1. Работать без привязки к окну
2. Использовать драйвер
3. Запустить слежение за клавишами "ВКЛ"
4. Запустить режим инкогнито "ВКЛ" (ОБЯЗАТЕЛЬНО!)
5. Использовать минимальную задержку "ВЫКЛ"
6. Забиндить на любую кнопку (Рекомендую ЛКМ или КОЛЁСИКО)
7. Выбрать режим работы "Пока зажата клавиша"
</Description>
    <Comment>If any problems contact - Fosiks£3968</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 4
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 4
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 4
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 4
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 3
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 3
Delay 5 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 20 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 4
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 4
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 4
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 4
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 5
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 5
Delay 5 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 61 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
